# =============================================================================
# Build context exclusions.
#
# deploy/docker/Dockerfile reads exactly two things from the context:
#
#   <service>/target/<service>-*.jar
#   deploy/docker/strip-native-libs.sh
#
# Everything else is sent to the daemon for nothing. That costs build time on
# every one of the five matrix jobs, but the reason this file exists is
# narrower: anything in the context can be COPYed, and a context containing
# .env files or private keys is one mistaken COPY away from baking them into a
# published layer. Excluding them here means the bytes never reach the daemon.
#
# NOTE: target/ is deliberately NOT excluded. The image is built from a jar
# produced by a prior `mvn package`, so excluding target/ breaks the COPY with
# "file not found" - which reads like a Dockerfile bug rather than a context one.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets. Never in a build context. -------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
secrets/
**/application-local.yml
**/application-secret.yml
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# --- Model weights ----------------------------------------------------------
# ~87 MB that no COPY references. The model is mounted or fetched at runtime.
models/
**/*.onnx
**/*.safetensors

# --- Version control and CI -------------------------------------------------
.git
.github
.gitignore
.gitattributes
Jenkinsfile

# --- Source. The image is built from the jar, never compiled in-context. -----
**/src
*.md
docs/
config/
scripts/
loadtest/
dashboard/
terraform/

# --- Build output that is not the fat jar -----------------------------------
# The repackaged fat jar is what gets copied; the plain jar Maven moves aside
# during repackage, the loose classes and every report are dead weight.
**/target/*.jar.original
**/target/classes
**/target/test-classes
**/target/generated-sources
**/target/generated-test-sources
**/target/maven-status
**/target/maven-archiver
**/target/surefire-reports
**/target/failsafe-reports
**/target/site
**/target/pit-reports
**/target/jacoco*
**/target/*.exec
**/target/spotbugs*
**/target/pmd*
**/target/cpd*

# --- Deployment manifests. Only the one script is needed. -------------------
deploy/helm
deploy/k8s
deploy/docker/README.md

# --- IDE / OS ---------------------------------------------------------------
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules
